flowchart LR
  CNT["ProductionCount (good/scrap/rework + weight)"] --> MY["Material yield + FPY/RTY"]
  GEN["Genealogy (COIL_NO)"] --> ATTR["Loss attribution by step/grade/lot"]
  MY & ATTR --> BR["Loss bridge (mass + units)"]
  RATE["CostRate: standard cost - salvage - rework cost (D7 rate-as-of)"] --> FIN["Financial Impact: HITS TWICE = lost margin + sunk conversion cost, net of salvage"]
  BR --> FIN
  MY & BR & FIN --> REG["Shared KPI Registry (UIL, doc 03): material yield, FPY, RTY, scrap/rework ratio, avoidable loss, recon gap, cost of loss"]
  REG --> MON["Monitoring: live yield tile + reconciliation / yield-drop alerts"]
  REG --> REP["Reporting: yield report, Sankey, league table, euro recovered"]
  REG --> SIB["M4 Quality reconciliation - M6 priced defect loss - M3 yield factors - M7 energy/good-unit"]
